('domain', 'D078', 'D078', 'skill', 'd078-care-for-research-data', 'Organise and protect research information when a project uses data', 'Research-data management means naming, documenting, storing and sharing information carefully so that it can be understood and protected. For example, a project may keep a codebook explaining what each survey column means while limiting access to identifying details.', 'Use this when a project creates, receives, stores or shares research information and needs to document what it contains, protect it and control access.', 'A simple file plan and short data note/codebook; example is illustrative.', 'build_next', 'Use this when a project creates, receives, stores or shares research information and needs to document what it contains, protect it and control access. Do not imply that every learner needs advanced data-management training or that an open-data practice overrides consent, privacy, security, retention or institutional policy. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['cessda_rdm', 'nuc_ccmas']::text[], '[{"id":"cessda_rdm","title":"Research Data Management in the Social Sciences","url":"https://www.cessda.eu/Training/Training-Resources/Resource-crd-4767","region":null,"evidenceType":"item_definition_or_task_identity"},{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"Social Sciences CCMAS 2023","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Social-Sciences-CCMAS-FINAL-2023-A.pdf","region":null,"evidenceType":"D078_checkpoint_context_candidate"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"cessda_rdm","title":"Research Data Management in the Social Sciences","url":"https://www.cessda.eu/Training/Training-Resources/Resource-crd-4767","locator":"data-management life cycle, planning to publication","claimRole":"item_identity"},{"sourceId":"nuc_ccmas","title":"Social Sciences CCMAS