('domain', 'D078', 'D078', 'tool', 'd078-survey-data-collection-tool', 'KoboToolbox for electronic form collection', 'KoboToolbox can build and deploy forms and collect/manage responses. It helps carry out a planned survey or field form; it does not decide sampling, question quality or what answers mean.', 'Use KoboToolbox when a planned form-based study needs electronic forms and response collection; the tool does not design the research question, sample or questionnaire for you.', 'A test form and sample export using fictional data.', 'build_next', 'Use KoboToolbox when a planned form-based study needs electronic forms and response collection; the tool does not design the research question, sample or questionnaire for you. The platform does not design a sound questionnaire, ensure representative sampling, obtain valid consent or make collected information accurate. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['kobo_essentials']::text[], '[{"id":"kobo_essentials","title":"KoboToolbox Essentials","url":"https://academy.kobotoolbox.org/courses/essentials","region":null,"evidenceType":"item_definition_or_task_identity"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"kobo_essentials","title":"KoboToolbox Essentials","url":"https://academy.kobotoolbox.org/courses/essentials","locator":"official free 3-hour 11-module course and form/data workflow","claimRole":"item_identity"},{"sourceId":"kobo_essentials","title":"KoboToolbox Essentials","url":"https://academy.kobotoolbox.org/courses/essentials","locator":"official free 3-hour 11-module course and form/data workflow","claimRole":"checkpoint_fit"},{"sourceId":"kobo_essentials","title":"KoboToolbox Essentials","url":"https://academy.kobotoolbox.org/courses/essentials","locator":"Official free, self-paced course, 11 modules/3 hours; designing forms, deploying, collect