('domain', 'D078', 'D078', 'tool', 'd078-social-network-tool', 'Gephi for visualising relationship data', 'Gephi can turn a table of connections into a network picture and calculate selected network measures. For example, links between organisations can be visualised; the picture alone does not prove influence or causation.', 'Use Gephi when defined relationship data need to be explored or visualised as a network; a network picture or metric does not establish influence or causation.', 'A clearly labelled network diagram from sample data with a note about what ties mean.', 'useful_later', 'Use Gephi when defined relationship data need to be explored or visualised as a network; a network picture or metric does not establish influence or causation. A visually striking graph or centrality score does not establish social importance, causal influence or representative network coverage. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['gephi_quickstart']::text[], '[{"id":"gephi_quickstart","title":"Gephi Quick Start","url":"https://gephi.org/quickstart/","region":null,"evidenceType":"item_definition_or_task_identity"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"gephi_quickstart","title":"Gephi Quick Start","url":"https://gephi.org/quickstart/","locator":"official quick start: source-target data, layout and metrics","claimRole":"item_identity"},{"sourceId":"gephi_quickstart","title":"Gephi Quick Start","url":"https://gephi.org/quickstart/","locator":"official quick start: source-target data, layout and metrics","claimRole":"checkpoint_fit"},{"sourceId":"gephi_quickstart","title":"Gephi Quick Start","url":"https://gephi.org/quickstart/","locator":"Official quick start: import source-target relationship data, visualize a network and use layout/metrics; linked example dataset.","claimRole":"plain_meaning"}]'::jsonb, 'glo