presentative network coverage. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.'),
('domain', 'D078', 'D078', 'tool', 'd078-excel-data-tool', 'Excel for organizing and summarising structured data', 'Excel can help organize a small table, check or filter entries, calculate simple summaries, and make charts. For example, a learner might summarize fictional survey responses by age group. Excel does not decide whether a survey sample is fair or whether a statistical conclusion is justified.', 'Use Excel when a task calls for organising, checking, filtering, summarising or charting a manageable table; it does not establish that the data or conclusion are valid.', 'A clearly labelled practice table with checked entries, one summary or PivotTable, and a chart or note explaining what the summary does and does not show.', 'useful_later', 'Use Excel when a task calls for organising, checking, filtering, summarising or charting a manageable table; it does not establish that the data or conclusion are valid. Do not present Excel as a research method, secure data-management system or reliable substitute for reproducible analysis at larger scale. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['excel_import_analyze']::text[], '[{"id":"excel_import_analyze","title":"Import and analyze data in Excel","url":"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/excel/import-and-analyze-data","region":null,"evidenceType":"item_definition_or_task_identity"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"excel_import_analyze","title":"Import and analyze data in Excel","url":"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/excel/import-and-analyze-data","locator":"Microsoft Support documents tables, sorting/filtering, charts, importing and PivotTables","claimRole":"item_identity"},{"sourceId":"excel_import_analyze","title":"Import and analyze data in Excel","url":"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/excel/import-and-analyze-data","locator":"Mic