('domain', 'D078', 'D078', 'tool', 'd078-nvivo-tool', 'NVivo for organizing and coding substantial qualitative material', 'NVivo helps researchers organize qualitative material such as interview transcripts and open-ended responses, attach codes to passages, retrieve coded sections and keep analytic notes. For a small project, careful manual coding or a free tool may be enough; NVivo does not choose a sound method or discover valid themes on its own.', 'Can support a documented qualitative workflow when a D078 question uses interviews, open responses, documents or multimedia; the researcher still defines the question, sampling, coding logic and interpretation.', 'A small codebook, a few coded fictional/public passages and a memo explaining how the codes relate to the question.', 'build_next', 'Can support a documented qualitative workflow when a D078 question uses interviews, open responses, documents or multimedia; the researcher still defines the question, sampling, coding logic and interpretation. NVivo does not perform interpretation on the researcher''s behalf, establish a valid theme, choose the method or remove software-access and licensing constraints. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nvivo_coding_guide', 'url_1194a7aca9d91ac4']::text[], '[{"id":"nvivo_coding_guide","title":"Essential qualitative coding techniques in NVivo","url":"https://lumivero.com/resources/blog/essential-qualitative-coding-techniques-nvivo/","region":null,"evidenceType":"item_definition_or_task_identity"},{"id":"url_1194a7aca9d91ac4","title":"Surviving Research / Prairie View A&M University workshop recording","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ulfu8jPTGUk","region":"global","evidenceType":"task_specific_learning_resource"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"nvivo_coding_guide","title":"Essential quali