('domain', 'D078', 'D078', 'tool', 'd078-mesa-tool', 'Mesa for building agent-based social simulations in Python', 'Mesa is a Python framework for agent-based modeling (ABM): a researcher writes rules for simulated individuals or organisations, runs the model, and examines what patterns emerge from their interactions. A model is a simplified set of assumptions—not a prediction of what real people will certainly do.', 'Can operationalise a stated social mechanism as interacting simulated agents and support scenario exploration; it is a model-building tool, not evidence by itself.', 'A small, documented toy model with explicit agent rules and assumptions, repeatable runs, collected results, and a comparison with evidence or alternative assumptions.', 'useful_later', 'Can operationalise a stated social mechanism as interacting simulated agents and support scenario exploration; it is a model-building tool, not evidence by itself. Mesa helps implement a model; it does not validate assumptions or make simulated outcomes observations of real society. Python and modelling concepts precede tool operation. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['mesa_first_model']::text[], '[{"id":"mesa_first_model","title":"Creating Your First Model","url":"https://mesa.readthedocs.io/stable/tutorials/0_first_model.html","region":null,"evidenceType":"item_definition_or_task_identity"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"mesa_first_model","title":"Creating Your First Model","url":"https://mesa.readthedocs.io/stable/tutorials/0_first_model.html","locator":"official getting-started tutorial builds a basic model and links data-collection/visualization tutorials","claimRole":"item_identity"},{"sourceId":"mesa_first_model","title":"Creating Your First Model","url":"https://mesa.readthedocs.io/stable/tutorials/0_first_model.html","locator":"official getting-started tutorial builds a basic model and links data-collection/visualization tutorials","claimRole":"checkpoint_fit"},{"sourceId":"mesa_first_model","title":"Creating Your First Model","url":"https://mesa.readthedocs.io/stable/tutorials/0_first_model.html","locator":"Official introductory tutorial builds a simple agent-based model step by step, starting with a model of agents exchanging wealth; Mesa getting-started guide links data collection and basic visualization tutorials.","claimRole":"plain_meaning"}]'::jsonb, 'global', '["Specialist, optional tool; not a shared D078 foundation.","Simulation output is conditional on assumptions and calibration; it is not observed evidence by itself.","A beginner tutorial does not establish that ABM is suitable for a given question.","Domain enrichment only. The programme-to-domain relationship does not mean this item is taught by the Sociology degree."]'::jsonb, 'source_supported_synthesis', 'medium', 'source_backed', 'linked', 'https://mesa.readthedocs.io/stable/tutorials/0_first_model.html', 'Mesa project', '{"source_id":"url_e28f131c0741d938","title":"Mesa project","publisher":"Mesa project","url":"https://mesa.readthedocs.io/stable/tutorials/0_first_model.html","locator":"Creating Your First Model; step-by-step agent-based model, data collection and visualization","accessed_on":"2026-10-09","scope_limit":null}'::jsonb, '2026-10-09', 'medium', '{"url":"https://mesa.readthedocs.io/stable/tutorials/0_first_model.html","locator":"Creating Your First Model; step-by-step agent-based model, data collection and visualization","supports":"Task-specific learning resource for the item","access":null}'::jsonb, NULL, 'domain', '2026-10-12', 'approved', '{"claims":{"item_identity":{"source_references":[{"id":"mesa_first_model","title":"Creating Your First Model","url":"https://mesa.readthedocs.io/stable/tutorials/0_first_model.html","region":null,"evidenceType":"item_definition_or_task_identity"}],"sour