('domain', 'D078', 'D078', 'competency', 'reliability_validity_and_uncertainty', 'Checking reliability, validity and uncertainty', 'Check whether evidence is consistent, measures what it claims to measure, and carries uncertainty or possible bias before drawing conclusions.', 'Check consistency, accuracy, bias and uncertainty before interpreting results.', 'A quality check that identifies likely sources of error, bias, uncertainty and limits on interpretation.', 'build_next', 'Check consistency, accuracy, bias and uncertainty before interpreting results. Separate measurement reliability, validity of an interpretation, design uncertainty and qualitative quality; no single coefficient certifies evidence quality. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['gesis_reliability_precision_guide', 'esrc_social_science_training_guidelines_2022', 'nuc_social_sciences_ccmas_2023_research_curriculum', 'open_text_reliability_validity_ch7']::text[], '[{"id":"gesis_reliability_precision_guide","title":"Reliability and Precision of Measurement","url":"https://www.gesis.org/fileadmin/admin/Dateikatalog/pdf/guidelines/reliability_precision_measurement_danner_2016.pdf","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"esrc_social_science_training_guidelines_2022","title":"ESRC Postgraduate Training and Development Guidelines 2022","url":"https://www.ukri.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/ESRC-281123-PostgraduateTrainingDevelopmentGuidelines2022.pdf","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"nuc_social_sciences_ccmas_2023_research_curriculum","title":"Social Sciences CCMAS 2023: research-methods curriculum examples","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Social-Sciences-CCMAS-FINAL-2023-A.pdf","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"open_text_reliability_validity_ch7","title":"Social Science Resear