('domain', 'D078', 'D078', 'method', 'pilot_and_cognitive_pretesting', 'Piloting questions before fieldwork', 'Try research questions or an instrument with a small group first to see whether people understand them as intended and whether the process works.', 'Test whether research questions are understood as intended before fieldwork.', 'A pilot note listing confusing wording, practical problems and justified changes before the main study.', 'build_next', 'Test whether research questions are understood as intended before fieldwork. Do not collapse cognitive interviewing into an operational pilot. They answer different questions and can be used separately or together when justified. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['gesis_cognitive_pretesting_guideline', 'aapor_best_practices_pretest_pilot', 'esrc_social_science_training_guidelines_2022', 'nuc_social_sciences_ccmas_2023_research_curriculum', 'aapor_pretest_pilot_explanation', 'gesis_cognitive_pretesting']::text[], '[{"id":"gesis_cognitive_pretesting_guideline","title":"Cognitive Pretesting","url":"https://www.gesis.org/gesis-guides/generated-guides/049-cognitive-pretesting-2","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"aapor_best_practices_pretest_pilot","title":"Best Practices for Survey Research — Questionnaire Pretesting and Pilots","url":"https://aapor.org/standards-and-ethics/best-practices/","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"esrc_social_science_training_guidelines_2022","title":"ESRC Postgraduate Training and Development Guidelines 2022","url":"https://www.ukri.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/ESRC-281123-PostgraduateTrainingDevelopmentGuidelines2022.pdf","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"nuc_social_sciences_ccmas_2023_research_curriculum","title":"Social Sciences CCMAS 2023: research-methods curriculum exampl