ation; do not imply every D078 role runs experiments. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.'),
('domain', 'D078', 'D078', 'method', 'programme_evaluation_and_theory_of_change', 'Programme evaluation and theory of change', 'Explain how a programme is expected to produce change, then gather evidence to judge its implementation, outcomes, value and limits.', 'Assess what changed, for whom, why, under what conditions and at what cost.', 'An evaluation plan linking activities to outputs, outcomes and assumptions, with measures, context, evidence sources and decision limits.', 'build_next', 'Assess what changed, for whom, why, under what conditions and at what cost. Do not reduce evaluation to impact measurement or treat a theory of change as proof that a programme caused an outcome. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['erasmus_theory_of_change_definition_2026', 'esrc_social_science_training_guidelines_2022', 'nuc_social_sciences_ccmas_2023_research_curriculum', 'nz_theory_of_change_plain_explanation_2026']::text[], '[{"id":"erasmus_theory_of_change_definition_2026","title":"Theory of Change","url":"https://www.eur.nl/en/research/research-services/societal-impact-evaluation/impact-toolbox/theory-change","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"esrc_social_science_training_guidelines_2022","title":"ESRC Postgraduate Training and Development Guidelines 2022","url":"https://www.ukri.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/ESRC-281123-PostgraduateTrainingDevelopmentGuidelines2022.pdf","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"nuc_social_sciences_ccmas_2023_research_curriculum","title":"Social Sciences CCMAS 2023: research-methods curriculum examples","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Social-Sciences-CCMAS-FINAL-2023-A.pdf","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"nz_theory_of_change_plain_explanation_2026","title":"A Theory of Change","url":"https://evaluationhub.edu