('domain', 'D078', 'D078', 'competency', 'open_science_preregistration_and_reproducibility', 'Keeping a clear, repeatable research record', 'Record plans, decisions, data descriptions, code, materials and changes so another person can inspect how the work was done and, where possible, repeat it.', 'Record plans, decisions, data dictionaries, code, materials and deviations so work can be inspected and repeated.', 'An organised research record with a plan, data dictionary or codebook, versioned materials and a note explaining deviations.', 'build_next', 'Record plans, decisions, data dictionaries, code, materials and deviations so work can be inspected and repeated. Separate a traceable research record from preregistration as one optional practice; neither is a credential or substitute for ethics review or good design. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['osf_preregistration_definition', 'esrc_social_science_training_guidelines_2022', 'esrc_research_training_scope_not_universal_preregistration', 'osf_preregistration_plain_explanation', 'osf_simplifying_preregistration']::text[], '[{"id":"osf_preregistration_definition","title":"Welcome to Registrations & Preregistrations","url":"https://help.osf.io/article/330-welcome-to-registrations","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"esrc_social_science_training_guidelines_2022","title":"ESRC Postgraduate Training and Development Guidelines 2022","url":"https://www.ukri.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/ESRC-281123-PostgraduateTrainingDevelopmentGuidelines2022.pdf","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"esrc_research_training_scope_not_universal_preregistration","title":"ESRC Postgraduate Training and Development Guidelines 2022","url":"https://www.ukri.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/ESRC-281123-PostgraduateTrainingDevelopmentGuidelines20