('domain', 'D078', 'D078', 'skill', 'reference_and_literature_management', 'Finding and organising research sources', 'Collect, organise, trace and cite books, articles, reports and other sources so that claims can be checked and connected to prior work.', 'Collect, organise, trace and cite books, articles, reports and other research sources.', 'A structured source list or library with consistent citations, notes and links back to the claims they support.', 'build_next', 'Collect, organise, trace and cite books, articles, reports and other research sources. Do not present Zotero as required or imply an organised bibliography verifies source quality, completeness or interpretation. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['zotero_reference_management_quick_start', 'esrc_social_science_training_guidelines_2022', 'esrc_social_science_research_communication_context', 'zotero_plain_language_reference_tool_explanation']::text[], '[{"id":"zotero_reference_management_quick_start","title":"Zotero Quick Start Guide","url":"https://www.zotero.org/support/quick_start_guide","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"esrc_social_science_training_guidelines_2022","title":"ESRC Postgraduate Training and Development Guidelines 2022","url":"https://www.ukri.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/ESRC-281123-PostgraduateTrainingDevelopmentGuidelines2022.pdf","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"esrc_social_science_research_communication_context","title":"ESRC Postgraduate Training and Development Guidelines 2022","url":"https://www.ukri.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/ESRC-281123-PostgraduateTrainingDevelopmentGuidelines2022.pdf","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"zotero_plain_language_reference_tool_explanation","title":"Zotero Quick Start Guide","url":"https://www.zotero.org/support/quick_start_gui