('domain', 'D078', 'D078', 'tool', 'd078_jupyter', 'Jupyter', 'Jupyter is a notebook environment where code, explanations, data outputs and visualisations can be kept together. It helps a learner show how a computational result was produced, but a notebook is not automatically a reproducible or valid study.', 'Keep code, explanation, data outputs and visualisations together in a shareable notebook.', 'A runnable, documented notebook and outputs with source, dependency and execution notes.', 'build_next', 'Keep code, explanation, data outputs and visualisations together in a shareable notebook. A notebook is not a statistical method, validated result or guarantee of reproducibility; environments, data and dependencies still matter. Optional domain-enrichment choice for the named task only; not required for every D078 learner or occupation, not proof of competence, and not claimed to be taught by the Sociology programme.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['url_45fe4712e74bbd47', 'url_4971ef18227673ce', 'jupyter_official_running_notebooks_2026']::text[], '[{"id":"url_45fe4712e74bbd47","title":"What is Jupyter?","url":"https://docs.jupyter.org/en/latest/what_is_jupyter.html","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"url_4971ef18227673ce","title":"Data Carpentries: Python for social scientists","url":"https://datacarpentry.org/python-socialsci/","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"jupyter_official_running_notebooks_2026","title":"Run and document a Jupyter notebook workflow","url":"https://docs.jupyter.org/en/latest/running.html","region":"global","evidenceType":"task_specific_learning_resource"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"url_45fe4712e74bbd47","title":"What is Jupyter?","url":"https://docs.jupyter.org/en/latest/what_is_jupyter.html","locator":"Notebook environment combining executable code, narrative text, equations and visualisations","claimRole":"item_identity"},{"sourceId":"url_4971ef18227673ce","title":"Data Carpentries: Python for social scientists","url":"https