('subgroup', 'D078:economics-applied-analysis', 'D078', 'competency', 'D078-ECON-REPRODUCIBLE-RESEARCH', 'Reproducible research workflow and data documentation', 'The ability to preserve data provenance, code, decisions, and outputs so another authorized analyst can understand and, where access permits, reproduce the analysis.', 'Supports credible economic analysis by making transformations and assumptions inspectable; it does not mean all underlying data can be publicly shared. Deliver a source log, data dictionary, versioned analysis code, environment/package record, README, and a reproducibility package that respects data restrictions. An additional research practice, not a presumed curriculum outcome. Route note: Show within the selected economics applied analysis area as a learner-selectable focus, not a compulsory mastery checkpoint. Task: Deliver a source log, data dictionary, versioned analysis code, environment/package record, README, and a reproducibility package that respects data restrictions. Guardrail: Reproducibility does not prove the model or causal claim is correct. Restricted microdata may require secure enclaves or controlled access.', 'Deliver a source log, data dictionary, versioned analysis code, environment/package record, README, and a reproducibility package that respects data restrictions.', 'build_next', 'Show within the selected economics applied analysis area as a learner-selectable focus, not a compulsory mastery checkpoint. Task: Deliver a source log, data dictionary, versioned analysis code, environment/package record, README, and a reproducibility package that respects data restrictions. Guardrail: Reproducibility does not prove the model or causal claim is correct. Restricted microdata may require secure enclaves or controlled access.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['WB_REPRODUCIBLE', 'UKDS_RDM']::text[], '[{"id":"WB_REPRODUCIBLE","title":"Guidance to Authors: Reproducible Research Repository","url":"https://worldbank.github.io/w