('subgroup', 'D078:economics-applied-analysis', 'D078', 'method', 'D078-ECON-ALTERNATIVE-DATA-NOWCAST', 'AI-assisted nowcasting from alternative data (experimental/context-dependent)', 'A workflow that uses timely nontraditional data and machine-learning/text methods to estimate current economic conditions before conventional official releases are available.', 'A specialist research edge for labour or activity monitoring; evidence includes World Bank work using social-media employment disclosures in the U.S., which does not validate direct transfer to Nigeria. Compare a timely signal to a clearly defined official target, validate it out of sample and across locations/time, report coverage and revision, and label it as an estimate rather than official statistics. Exploratory learning only; no Nigeria-specific performance claim. Route note: Show only within the selected economics applied analysis area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: Compare a timely signal to a clearly defined official target, validate it out of sample and across locations/time, report coverage and revision, and label it as an estimate rather than official statistics. Guardrail: A U.S. demonstration does not establish Nigeria validity. Platform populations and API access create selection and drift risks.', 'Compare a timely signal to a clearly defined official target, validate it out of sample and across locations/time, report coverage and revision, and label it as an estimate rather than official statistics.', 'useful_later', 'Show only within the selected economics applied analysis area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: Compare a timely signal to a clearly defined official target, validate it out of sample and across locations/time, report coverage and revision, and label it as an estimate rather than official statistics. Guardrail: A U.S. demonstration does not establish Nigeria validity. Platform populations and API access create selection and drift risks.', '[]