('subgroup', 'D078:economics-applied-analysis', 'D078', 'knowledge', 'D078-ECON-PUBLIC-FINANCE-STATISTICS', 'Public-finance statistics and fiscal analysis concepts', 'Knowledge of how government revenue, spending, financing, assets and liabilities are organized in fiscal-statistics frameworks so they can be interpreted consistently for economic analysis.', 'Supports applied analysis of budgets, fiscal stance and public-sector activity; it does not make a learner an official compiler or substitute for accounting/audit qualifications. Read a fiscal table or dataset, identify government coverage, cash/accrual basis, classifications and period, then explain the indicator''s policy meaning and what it leaves out. An optional applied-economics enrichment item; no specific Nigerian public-finance course content is claimed. Route note: Show within the selected economics applied analysis area as a learner-selectable focus, not a compulsory mastery checkpoint. Task: Read a fiscal table or dataset, identify government coverage, cash/accrual basis, classifications and period, then explain the indicator''s policy meaning and what it leaves out. Guardrail: GFSM is a specialized statistical framework; compiler guidance and country adoption status matter. The IMF states that GFSM 2014 is being updated, with completion targeted for 2027; use current version/metadata.', 'Read a fiscal table or dataset, identify government coverage, cash/accrual basis, classifications and period, then explain the indicator''s policy meaning and what it leaves out.', 'build_next', 'Show within the selected economics applied analysis area as a learner-selectable focus, not a compulsory mastery checkpoint. Task: Read a fiscal table or dataset, identify government coverage, cash/accrual basis, classifications and period, then explain the indicator''s policy meaning and what it leaves out. Guardrail: GFSM is a specialized statistical framework; compiler guidance and country adoption status matter. The IMF 