('subgroup', 'D078:economics-applied-analysis', 'D078', 'knowledge', 'ECON-K1', 'Economic concepts, indicators and measurement', 'Understanding economic concepts and how indicators are defined, collected, scaled, revised and compared.', 'Area-specific economic interpretation, distinct from a generic data skill. Helps explain what a price, output, employment, income or welfare measure does and what it misses. Do not imply taught by a selected programme unless its curriculum record supports it. Route note: Show within the selected economics applied analysis area as a learner-selectable focus, not a compulsory mastery checkpoint. Task: Helps explain what a price, output, employment, income or welfare measure does and what it misses. Guardrail: No single indicator captures all welfare or economic activity; definitions and coverage matter.', 'Helps explain what a price, output, employment, income or welfare measure does and what it misses.', 'build_next', 'Show within the selected economics applied analysis area as a learner-selectable focus, not a compulsory mastery checkpoint. Task: Helps explain what a price, output, employment, income or welfare measure does and what it misses. Guardrail: No single indicator captures all welfare or economic activity; definitions and coverage matter.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['CORE_ECON_OPEN', 'NBS_NLSS', 'NISER_EIR_2026']::text[], '[{"id":"CORE_ECON_OPEN","title":"The Economy: Economy, Society, and Public Policy","url":"https://www.core-econ.org/espp/","region":"Global open resource","evidenceType":null},{"id":"NBS_NLSS","title":"Nigeria Living Standards Survey 2018â€“2019","url":"https://microdata.nigerianstat.gov.ng/index.php/catalog/68","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":null},{"id":"NISER_EIR_2026","title":"NISER Economic Intelligence Report 2026","url":"https://niser.gov.ng/v2/niser-economic-intelligence-report-2026/","region":"Nigeria; 2026 report","evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"CORE_ECON_OPEN","title":"Th