('subgroup', 'D078:economics-applied-analysis', 'D078', 'tool', 'ECON-A2', 'Generative-AI support for bounded economics research tasks', 'Using a language model to assist selected microtasks—such as code scaffolding, drafting a search plan or explaining an error—while an economist checks the result against evidence and code execution.', 'An optional emerging workflow aid across economic research tasks, not a separate method or a required tool. May reduce time on routine support work; does not produce a defensible economic result without human methods and verification. Not claimed as taught content. Route note: Show only within the selected economics applied analysis area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: May reduce time on routine support work; does not produce a defensible economic result without human methods and verification. Guardrail: Hallucinated citations, incorrect code/math, data leakage and version drift; do not use as unchecked source, analyst or author.', 'May reduce time on routine support work; does not produce a defensible economic result without human methods and verification.', 'useful_later', 'Show only within the selected economics applied analysis area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: May reduce time on routine support work; does not produce a defensible economic result without human methods and verification. Guardrail: Hallucinated citations, incorrect code/math, data leakage and version drift; do not use as unchecked source, analyst or author.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['AEA_GENAI_ECON', 'AEA_AI_AGENTS_UPDATE']::text[], '[{"id":"AEA_GENAI_ECON","title":"Generative AI for Economic Research: Use Cases and Implications for Economists","url":"https://www.aeaweb.org/articles?id=10.1257/jel.20231736","region":"International research literature; AEA publisher","evidenceType":null},{"id":"AEA_AI_AGENTS_UPDATE","title":"AI Agents for Economic Research: August 2025 Update","url":"https://www.aeaweb.org/articles/m