('subgroup', 'D078:economics-applied-analysis', 'D078', 'competency', 'ECON-C3', 'Human verification and disclosure of AI-assisted research', 'Ability to verify factual and computational outputs, retain a reproducible record and follow applicable disclosure/data rules when AI assists research.', 'Conditional governance capability for AI use, not a prerequisite for non-AI economic analysis. Makes the division between tool assistance and researcher judgment visible and auditable. Not claimed as a programme outcome. Route note: Show within the selected economics applied analysis area as a learner-selectable focus, not a compulsory mastery checkpoint. Task: Makes the division between tool assistance and researcher judgment visible and auditable. Guardrail: Disclosure does not make an invalid analysis valid; requirements vary by employer, publisher and jurisdiction.', 'Makes the division between tool assistance and researcher judgment visible and auditable.', 'build_next', 'Show within the selected economics applied analysis area as a learner-selectable focus, not a compulsory mastery checkpoint. Task: Makes the division between tool assistance and researcher judgment visible and auditable. Guardrail: Disclosure does not make an invalid analysis valid; requirements vary by employer, publisher and jurisdiction.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['AEA_GENAI_ECON', 'AEA_AI_AGENTS_UPDATE']::text[], '[{"id":"AEA_GENAI_ECON","title":"Generative AI for Economic Research: Use Cases and Implications for Economists","url":"https://www.aeaweb.org/articles?id=10.1257/jel.20231736","region":"International research literature; AEA publisher","evidenceType":null},{"id":"AEA_AI_AGENTS_UPDATE","title":"AI Agents for Economic Research: August 2025 Update","url":"https://www.aeaweb.org/articles/materials/23826","region":"Research use-case resource","evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"AEA_GENAI_ECON","title":"Generative AI for Economic Research: Use Cases and Implications for Econo