ting provides online and PDF formats under CC BY.","claimRole":"plain_meaning"},{"sourceId":"UNSD_CENSUS_2030","title":"2030 World Population and Housing Census Programme","url":"https://unstats.un.org/unsd/demographic/sources/census/wphc/default.htm","locator":"Programme overview and Principles and Recommendations for Population and Housing Censuses, Revision 4: census as a primary source of disaggregated data; programme objectives include comparable, integrated and quality-assured census data.","claimRole":"plain_meaning"}]},"contextual_use":{"source_references":[{"id":"OPEN_HUMAN_GEOGRAPHY","title":"Fundamentals of Human Geography","url":"https://open.umn.edu/opentextbooks/textbooks/fundamentals-of-human-geography","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"UNSD_CENSUS_2030","title":"2030 World Population and Housing Census Programme","url":"https://unstats.un.org/unsd/demographic/sources/census/wphc/default.htm","region":null,"evidenceType":null}],"source_locators":[{"sourceId":"OPEN_HUMAN_GEOGRAPHY","title":"Fundamentals of Human Geography","url":"https://open.umn.edu/opentextbooks/textbooks/fundamentals-of-human-geography","locator":"Table of Contents: Chapter 1 Introduction to Human Geography; Chapter 2 Population and Health; Chapter 3 Migration; Chapter 12 Human Settlements. Listing provides online and PDF formats under CC BY.","claimRole":"contextual_use"},{"sourceId":"UNSD_CENSUS_2030","title":"2030 World Population and Housing Census Programme","url":"https://unstats.un.org/unsd/demographic/sources/census/wphc/default.htm","locator":"Programme overview and Principles and Recommendations for Population and Housing Censuses, Revision 4: census as a primary source of disaggregated data; programme objectives include comparable, integrated and quality-assured census data.","claimRole":"contextual_use"}]}},"reviewed_by":"local_d078_item_disposition","decision_id":"D078:human-geography-population:spatial-concepts-and-place"}'::jsonb, 'free_task_specific_learning_