('subgroup', 'D078:human-geography-population', 'D078', 'method', 'D078:human-geography-population:spatial-analysis-method', 'Spatial analysis and map-based comparison', 'A method for comparing social conditions across locations or scales using appropriate spatial data, map choices and analytical operations.', 'This is a D078 area-level addition or route-specific option, not automatically a shared domain foundation. Do not claim that the selected programme teaches this item unless programme curriculum/outcome evidence supports that exact claim; otherwise label it domain/area enrichment. Route note: Optional method for questions where spatial pattern or distance is relevant; maps do not establish causation.', NULL, 'useful_later', 'Optional method for questions where spatial pattern or distance is relevant; maps do not establish causation.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['QGIS_TRAINING', 'UNSD_CENSUS_2030', 'NBS_GHS_PANEL_2023_24']::text[], '[{"id":"QGIS_TRAINING","title":"QGIS Training Manual, version 3.44","url":"https://docs.qgis.org/3.44/en/docs/training_manual/","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"UNSD_CENSUS_2030","title":"2030 World Population and Housing Census Programme","url":"https://unstats.un.org/unsd/demographic/sources/census/wphc/default.htm","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"NBS_GHS_PANEL_2023_24","title":"Nigeria General Household Survey, Panel 2023-2024, Wave 5","url":"https://microdata.nigerianstat.gov.ng/index.php/catalog/82","region":null,"evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"QGIS_TRAINING","title":"QGIS Training Manual, version 3.44","url":"https://docs.qgis.org/3.44/en/docs/training_manual/","locator":"Contents: 2 Creating and Exploring a Basic Map; 3 Classifying Vector Data; 4 Laying out the Maps; 6 Vector Analysis (reprojecting/transforming, vector analysis, network analysis, spatial statistics); 13 Assessment (base map, analyse data, final map).","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"UNSD_CENSUS_2030","title":"2030 World Population and Housing Census Programme","url":"https://unstats.un.org/unsd/demographic/sources/census/wphc/default.htm","locator":"Programme overview and Principles and Recommendations for Population and Housing Censuses, Revision 4: census as a primary source of disaggregated data; programme objectives include comparable, integrated and quality-assured census data.","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"NBS_GHS_PANEL_2023_24","title":"Nigeria General Household Survey, Panel 2023-2024, Wave 5","url":"https://microdata.nigerianstat.gov.ng/index.php/catalog/82","locator":"Catalogue sections Identification, Version, Scope and Sampling: nationally representative panel of about 5,000 households and six geopolitical zones; household geographic-area identification, migration, labour, education and other modules; anonymized public-distribution dataset metadata.","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"QGIS_TRAINING","title":"QGIS Training Manual, version 3.44","url":"https://docs.qgis.org/3.44/en/docs/training_manual/","locator":"Contents: 2 Creating and Exploring a Basic Map; 3 Classifying Vector Data; 4 Laying out the Maps; 6 Vector Analysis (reprojecting/transforming, vector analysis, network analysis, spatial statistics); 13 Assessment (base map, analyse data, final map).","claimRole":"task_specific_learning_resource"}]'::jsonb, 'nigeria_to_global', '["Spatial association is not causation.","A GIS procedure does not validate the measure, data coverage or policy conclusion.","Spatial association is not causal evidence; coordinate systems, boundary changes, missingness and unit choice can alter results.","Optional method for questions where spatial pattern or distance is relevant; maps do not establish causation."]'::jsonb, 'source_supported_synthesis', 'medium', 'source_backed', 'linked', 'https://docs.qgis.org/3.44/en/docs/training_manual/', 'QGIS Training Manual, version 3.44', '{"source_id":"QGIS_TRAINING","title":"QGIS Training Manual, version 3.44","publisher":"QGIS Project / Open S