('subgroup', 'D078:human-geography-population', 'D078', 'knowledge', 'D078:human-geography-population:population-measures', 'Population measures and demographic change', 'Understanding population size, composition, fertility, mortality, migration, growth and change over time.', 'This is a D078 area-level addition or route-specific option, not automatically a shared domain foundation. Do not claim that the selected programme teaches this item unless programme curriculum/outcome evidence supports that exact claim; otherwise label it domain/area enrichment. Route note: Use when the question needs population counts, rates or change measures; define denominator and reference period.', NULL, 'build_next', 'Use when the question needs population counts, rates or change measures; define denominator and reference period.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['IUSSP_DEMOGRAPHIC_METHODS', 'UNSD_MIGRATION_STATS', 'NBS_GHS_PANEL_2023_24']::text[], '[{"id":"IUSSP_DEMOGRAPHIC_METHODS","title":"Introduction to Demographic Methods and Population Analysis","url":"https://iussp.org/en/demographic-methods-and-population-analysis","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"UNSD_MIGRATION_STATS","title":"International migration statistics: methods and resources","url":"https://unstats.un.org/unsd/demographic-social/sconcerns/migration/","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"NBS_GHS_PANEL_2023_24","title":"Nigeria General Household Survey, Panel 2023-2024, Wave 5","url":"https://microdata.nigerianstat.gov.ng/index.php/catalog/82","region":null,"evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"IUSSP_DEMOGRAPHIC_METHODS","title":"Introduction to Demographic Methods and Population Analysis","url":"https://iussp.org/en/demographic-methods-and-population-analysis","locator":"Course overview: 28 interactive self-study lectures in three modules covering measurement/analysis of fertility, mortality and migration, population projections, life tables and population models.","claimRole":null},{"sourceId"