('subgroup', 'D078:politics-governance-public-policy', 'D078', 'skill', 'D078-A03-skill-stakeholder-mapping', 'Stakeholder and affected-group mapping', 'A structured way to identify people, institutions and groups that influence or experience a policy.', 'Prepare an actor map naming interests, influence, likely effects, missing voices and engagement routes for a bounded policy question. No direct curriculum transfer is asserted. D078 programme-to-domain evidence supplies route context; this area candidate is enrichment unless separately supported by programme evidence. Route note: A policy-analysis technique for making relevant actors and affected groups visible, not a claim that a map captures every voice.', NULL, 'build_next', 'A policy-analysis technique for making relevant actors and affected groups visible, not a claim that a map captures every voice.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['AEA_COMPETENCIES', 'AEA_STANDARDS', 'NIGERIA_MNEP', 'OPENLEARN_POLICY']::text[], '[{"id":"AEA_COMPETENCIES","title":"AEA Evaluator Competencies","url":"https://www.eval.org/About/Competencies-Standards/AEA-Evaluator-Competencies","region":"United States association with international membership; not a statutory licence","evidenceType":"professional association competency framework"},{"id":"AEA_STANDARDS","title":"Program Evaluation Standards","url":"https://www.eval.org/About/Competencies-Standards/Program-Evaluation-Standards","region":"international association context","evidenceType":"professional standards"},{"id":"NIGERIA_MNEP","title":"National Monitoring and Evaluation Policy of Nigeria","url":"https://nationalplanning.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/NPC-MNEP-LATEST.pdf","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":"national policy framework"},{"id":"OPENLEARN_POLICY","title":"Carrying out research for policy and advocacy work","url":"https://www.open.edu/openlearn/society-politics-law/carrying-out-research-policy-and-advocacy-work","region":"global teaching resource; examples may 