('subgroup', 'D078:politics-governance-public-policy', 'D078', 'skill', 'D078-A03-skill-policy-brief-writing', 'Policy brief and evidence communication', 'Writing a decision-focused document that separates evidence, interpretation, values, recommendation and limitations.', 'Turn an evidence review into a short brief with issue, evidence, options, trade-offs, recommendation conditions and references. No direct curriculum transfer is asserted. D078 programme-to-domain evidence supplies route context; this area candidate is enrichment unless separately supported by programme evidence. Route note: Write for a named decision audience while preserving uncertainty, source traceability and competing considerations.', NULL, 'build_next', 'Write for a named decision audience while preserving uncertainty, source traceability and competing considerations.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['BLS_POLSCI', 'NISER_BRIEFS', 'AEA_STANDARDS', 'NIGERIA_MNEP', 'OPENLEARN_POLICY']::text[], '[{"id":"BLS_POLSCI","title":"Political Scientists, Occupational Outlook Handbook","url":"https://www.bls.gov/ooh/life-physical-and-social-science/political-scientists.htm","region":"United States","evidenceType":"government occupational explainer"},{"id":"NISER_BRIEFS","title":"Policy Briefs","url":"https://niser.gov.ng/v2/briefs/","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":"national research institute outputs"},{"id":"AEA_STANDARDS","title":"Program Evaluation Standards","url":"https://www.eval.org/About/Competencies-Standards/Program-Evaluation-Standards","region":"international association context","evidenceType":"professional standards"},{"id":"NIGERIA_MNEP","title":"National Monitoring and Evaluation Policy of Nigeria","url":"https://nationalplanning.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/NPC-MNEP-LATEST.pdf","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":"national policy framework"},{"id":"OPENLEARN_POLICY","title":"Carrying out research for policy and advocacy work","url":"https://www.open.edu/openlearn/society-politics-l