('subgroup', 'D078:politics-governance-public-policy', 'D078', 'competency', 'D078-A34-A03-competency-inclusion-response-accountability', 'Plan inclusive participation and close the feedback loop', 'Select participation arrangements that fit people and the decision, notice who may be excluded, and document how contributions receive a public or participant-facing response.', 'Maintain an inclusion-and-response log connecting groups, access supports, input themes, official responses and follow-up actions. No direct curriculum transfer is asserted. D078 programme-to-domain evidence supplies route context; this area candidate is enrichment unless separately supported by programme evidence. Route note: A specialist competency for a defined consultation or accountability process.', NULL, 'build_next', 'A specialist competency for a defined consultation or accountability process.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['A34_OECD_CITIZEN_PARTICIPATION', 'A34_OECD_PARTICIPATION_CHAPTER', 'A34_NIGERIA_NSPSR']::text[], '[{"id":"A34_OECD_CITIZEN_PARTICIPATION","title":"OECD Guidelines for Citizen Participation Processes","url":"https://www.oecd.org/content/dam/oecd/en/publications/reports/2022/09/oecd-guidelines-for-citizen-participation-processes_63b34541/f765caf6-en.pdf","region":"international comparative guidance","evidenceType":null},{"id":"A34_OECD_PARTICIPATION_CHAPTER","title":"Planning, implementing, and evaluating a citizen participation process","url":"https://www.oecd.org/en/publications/oecd-guidelines-for-citizen-participation-processes_f765caf6-en/full-report/component-6.html","region":"international comparative guidance","evidenceType":null},{"id":"A34_NIGERIA_NSPSR","title":"National Strategy for Public Service Reform (NSPSR), reviewed/updated 2023","url":"https://bpsr.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/NSPSR-Reviewed-Updated-2023-v2.pdf","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"A34_OECD_CITIZEN_PARTICIPATION","title":"OECD Guidelines for Citiz