('subgroup', 'D078:politics-governance-public-policy', 'D078', 'method', 'D078-A34-A03-method-community-scorecard', 'Community scorecard and social-accountability monitoring', 'Bring community evidence and service-provider evidence into a structured local dialogue about a service or public project. The Nigerian legislative manual specifically describes community-level performance assessment, input tracking, provider self-evaluation and an interface meeting.', 'Create a scorecard and action matrix recording community observations, provider response, agreed actions and follow-up. No direct curriculum transfer is asserted. D078 programme-to-domain evidence supplies route context; this area candidate is enrichment unless separately supported by programme evidence. Route note: A community-facing monitoring approach for a selected service/project and locally agreed criteria.', NULL, 'build_next', 'A community-facing monitoring approach for a selected service/project and locally agreed criteria.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['A34_NILDS_OVERSIGHT_MANUAL', 'A34_NILDS_REPOSITORY', 'A34_NILDS_MANDATE']::text[], '[{"id":"A34_NILDS_OVERSIGHT_MANUAL","title":"Legislative Oversight Manual","url":"https://nilds.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/oversight_manual.pdf","region":"Nigeria; legislative oversight context","evidenceType":null},{"id":"A34_NILDS_REPOSITORY","title":"Legislative Oversight Manual repository record","url":"https://ir.nilds.gov.ng/handle/123456789/784?show=full","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":null},{"id":"A34_NILDS_MANDATE","title":"About the Institute","url":"https://nilds.gov.ng/about/","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"A34_NILDS_OVERSIGHT_MANUAL","title":"Legislative Oversight Manual","url":"https://nilds.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/oversight_manual.pdf","locator":"Printed pp.50-53 / PDF pp.57-60, §5.12(a)-(b), ''Oversight of Service Delivery: The Community Score Card'': community as unit, FGDs, immediate feedback/j