('subgroup', 'D078:politics-governance-public-policy', 'D078', 'skill', 'D078-A34-A03-skill-public-evidence-tracking', 'Track public-service commitments against documentary and community evidence', 'Connect a budget/project/service commitment to available records and community observations without treating either source as self-validating.', 'Maintain a dated tracker linking each public commitment to its source, indicator, observed evidence, response and unresolved question. No direct curriculum transfer is asserted. D078 programme-to-domain evidence supplies route context; this area candidate is enrichment unless separately supported by programme evidence. Route note: A bounded monitoring skill for a named service, project or budget commitment.', NULL, 'build_next', 'A bounded monitoring skill for a named service, project or budget commitment.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['A34_NILDS_OVERSIGHT_MANUAL', 'A34_BUDGET_IMONITOR', 'A34_NILDS_MANDATE']::text[], '[{"id":"A34_NILDS_OVERSIGHT_MANUAL","title":"Legislative Oversight Manual","url":"https://nilds.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/oversight_manual.pdf","region":"Nigeria; legislative oversight context","evidenceType":null},{"id":"A34_BUDGET_IMONITOR","title":"Nigeria Budget Info - I-Monitor Portal","url":"https://budgetoffice.gov.ng/imonitor/","region":"Nigeria; federal budget/project information","evidenceType":null},{"id":"A34_NILDS_MANDATE","title":"About the Institute","url":"https://nilds.gov.ng/about/","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"A34_NILDS_OVERSIGHT_MANUAL","title":"Legislative Oversight Manual","url":"https://nilds.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/oversight_manual.pdf","locator":"Printed pp.50-53 / PDF pp.57-60, §5.12(a)-(b), ''Oversight of Service Delivery: The Community Score Card'': community as unit, FGDs, immediate feedback/joint decisions, six CSC stages, input tracking matrix, scoring, provider self-evaluation and interface meeting; preparation/scoping and me