; legislative oversight","evidence_strength":"direct national institutional manual; free PDF verified","supports":"practical Nigerian learning route for scorecard/social-accountability method","limits":"not video-based or a universal protocol; access confirmed, reuse/licence terms not separately reviewed","access_date":"2026-10-10","access_check":"PDF opened; relevant pages/text visible","locator":"Printed pp.50-53 / PDF pp.57-60, §§5.12(a)-(b), CSC purpose, stages, input matrix, community/provider meetings and preparation."}'::jsonb, '2026-10-12', 'medium', '{"url":"https://nilds.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/oversight_manual.pdf","locator":"Printed pp.50-53 / PDF pp.57-60, §§5.12(a)-(b), CSC purpose, stages, input matrix, community/provider meetings and preparation.","supports":"practical Nigerian learning route for scorecard/social-accountability method","access":null}'::jsonb, NULL, 'subgroup', '2026-10-12', 'approved', '{"claims":{"item_identity":{"source_references":[{"id":"A34_NILDS_OVERSIGHT_MANUAL","title":"Legislative Oversight Manual","url":"https://nilds.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/oversight_manual.pdf","region":"Nigeria; legislative oversight context","evidenceType":null},{"id":"A34_BUDGET_IMONITOR","title":"Nigeria Budget Info - I-Monitor Portal","url":"https://budgetoffice.gov.ng/imonitor/","region":"Nigeria; federal budget/project information","evidenceType":null},{"id":"A34_NILDS_MANDATE","title":"About the Institute","url":"https://nilds.gov.ng/about/","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":null}],"source_locators":[{"sourceId":"A34_NILDS_OVERSIGHT_MANUAL","title":"Legislative Oversight Manual","url":"https://nilds.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/oversight_manual.pdf","locator":"Printed pp.50-53 / PDF pp.57-60, §5.12(a)-(b), ''Oversight of Service Delivery: The Community Score Card'': community as unit, FGDs, immediate feedback/joint decisions, six CSC stages, input tracking matrix, scoring, provider self-evaluation and interface meeting; pr