('subgroup', 'D078:politics-governance-public-policy', 'D078', 'tool', 'D078-A03-tool-rayyan-screening', 'Rayyan for organizing and assisting review screening', 'A web platform for organizing references and coordinating title/abstract and full-text decisions in evidence reviews.', 'Import references, apply human-defined inclusion criteria, resolve disagreements and preserve screening decisions. A niche tool option within the policy evidence-review branch; not a domain-wide tool and not a credential. No curriculum transfer claim is made. Route note: Optional review-management software for a defined evidence review.', NULL, 'useful_later', 'Optional review-management software for a defined evidence review.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['RAYYAN_PRODUCT_DOCS', 'RAYYAN_VIDEO_TUTORIAL']::text[], '[{"id":"RAYYAN_PRODUCT_DOCS","title":"AI-Powered Systematic Review Platform and Help Center","url":"https://help.rayyan.ai/hc/en-us","region":"Global commercial software; account features/pricing vary and may change","evidenceType":null},{"id":"RAYYAN_VIDEO_TUTORIAL","title":"How to do a Systematic Review | Rayyan Systematic Review Tutorial","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1YWABilWWIg","region":"Global product tutorial","evidenceType":"task_specific_learning_resource"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"RAYYAN_PRODUCT_DOCS","title":"AI-Powered Systematic Review Platform and Help Center","url":"https://help.rayyan.ai/hc/en-us","locator":"General product identity and reference-management/screening help; feature and plan claims are assigned to the separately dated official help-center records RAYYAN_PLANS_2026, RAYYAN_RELEVANCE_RANKING_2026 and RAYYAN_RESEARCHPILOT_2026.","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"RAYYAN_PRODUCT_DOCS","title":"AI-Powered Systematic Review Platform and Help Center","url":"https://help.rayyan.ai/hc/en-us","locator":"General product identity and reference-management/screening help; feature and plan claims are assigned to the separately dated official help-center 