('subgroup', 'D078:politics-governance-public-policy', 'D078', 'competency', 'D078-A03-competency-review-auditability', 'Verify and document AI-assisted review decisions', 'The ability to check AI-supported search, screening or extraction against the protocol and original sources, then document what was checked and changed.', 'Record tool/model, task, prompts or settings where relevant, human checks, corrections, exclusions and final responsibility. A specialist research-quality capability, not an assumed competency of every D078 learner. Programme relation is not established here. Route note: A quality and transparency practice for AI-assisted evidence work, not a separate claim of AI expertise.', NULL, 'build_next', 'A quality and transparency practice for AI-assisted evidence work, not a separate claim of AI expertise.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['RAISE_COHCRANE_GUIDANCE', 'OECD_GOVERNING_AI_2025', 'RAYYAN_VIDEO_TUTORIAL']::text[], '[{"id":"RAISE_COHCRANE_GUIDANCE","title":"Recommendations and guidance on responsible AI in evidence synthesis","url":"https://training-noproxy.cochrane.org/resource/recommendations-and-guidance-responsible-ai-in-evidence-synthesis","region":"International evidence-synthesis practice","evidenceType":null},{"id":"OECD_GOVERNING_AI_2025","title":"Governing with Artificial Intelligence: The State of Play and Way Forward in Core Government Functions","url":"https://www.oecd.org/en/publications/governing-with-artificial-intelligence_795de142-en.html","region":"International comparative policy evidence (OECD member and partner cases)","evidenceType":null},{"id":"RAYYAN_VIDEO_TUTORIAL","title":"How to do a Systematic Review | Rayyan Systematic Review Tutorial","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1YWABilWWIg","region":"Global product tutorial","evidenceType":"task_specific_learning_resource"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"RAISE_COHCRANE_GUIDANCE","title":"Recommendations and guidance on responsible AI in evidence synthesis","url":"https:/