('subgroup', 'D078:psychology-social-behaviour', 'D078', 'tool', 'D078-A04-tool-nvivo-tagging', 'NVivo or Taguette for qualitative coding', 'Software for organising source material and applying documented codes or categories to qualitative data.', 'Import permitted transcripts/documents, create a transparent code structure, retrieve coded passages and preserve analytic memos. No direct curriculum transfer is asserted. D078 programme-to-domain evidence supplies route context; this area candidate is enrichment unless separately supported by programme evidence. Route note: Optional software to store, organize, retrieve and code qualitative material; NVivo is commercial, Taguette is an alternative. Neither interprets data for the researcher.', NULL, 'useful_later', 'Optional software to store, organize, retrieve and code qualitative material; NVivo is commercial, Taguette is an alternative. Neither interprets data for the researcher.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['LUMIVERO_NVIVO', 'TAGUETTE_DOCS', 'APA_GUIDELINES']::text[], '[{"id":"LUMIVERO_NVIVO","title":"NVivo Product Tour: Qualitative Data Analysis","url":"https://lumivero.com/products/nvivo-old/nvivo-product-tour/","region":"global tool","evidenceType":"maintained vendor documentation"},{"id":"TAGUETTE_DOCS","title":"Taguette qualitative analysis documentation","url":"https://www.taguette.org/","region":"global tool","evidenceType":"maintained tool documentation"},{"id":"APA_GUIDELINES","title":"Guidelines for the Undergraduate Psychology Major, Version 3.0","url":"https://www.apa.org/ed/precollege/undergraduate-major","region":"international professional body; U.S. association","evidenceType":"professional education guideline"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"LUMIVERO_NVIVO","title":"NVivo Product Tour: Qualitative Data Analysis","url":"https://lumivero.com/products/nvivo-old/nvivo-product-tour/","locator":"Importing, coding, cases, classifications, queries, memos and visualisations for qualitative material.","claimR