('subgroup', 'D078:psychology-social-behaviour', 'D078', 'skill', 'D078-A04-skill-measurement-analysis', 'Operationalise, analyse and communicate behavioural measures', 'Turning a behavioural idea into a documented measure, checking the data and explaining numerical results with uncertainty.', 'Operationalise a construct, check measure quality, analyse data using an appropriate method and explain results and limitations. No direct curriculum transfer is asserted. D078 programme-to-domain evidence supplies route context; this area candidate is enrichment unless separately supported by programme evidence. Route note: Use measurement and analysis for a specified behavioural question; do not imply clinical testing or diagnosis.', NULL, 'build_next', 'Use measurement and analysis for a specified behavioural question; do not imply clinical testing or diagnosis.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['APA_GUIDELINES', 'NIGERIA_CCMAS', 'DATACARPENTRY_SOCIAL_R']::text[], '[{"id":"APA_GUIDELINES","title":"Guidelines for the Undergraduate Psychology Major, Version 3.0","url":"https://www.apa.org/ed/precollege/undergraduate-major","region":"international professional body; U.S. association","evidenceType":"professional education guideline"},{"id":"NIGERIA_CCMAS","title":"Social Sciences CCMAS 2023","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Social-Sciences-CCMAS-FINAL-2023-A.pdf","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":"national curriculum standard"},{"id":"DATACARPENTRY_SOCIAL_R","title":"Data Carpentry lessons","url":"https://datacarpentry.org/lessons/","region":"global teaching resource","evidenceType":"task_specific_learning_resource"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"APA_GUIDELINES","title":"Guidelines for the Undergraduate Psychology Major, Version 3.0","url":"https://www.apa.org/ed/precollege/undergraduate-major","locator":"Goals/outcomes on psychological content, scientific inquiry, critical thinking, methods, measurement, statistics and ethical behaviour","claimRole":"profe