ences.","claimRole":"contextual_use"},{"sourceId":"A34_NIGERIA_BIRDLAB","title":"NETBRECSIN Newsletter: Behavioural Insights Research and Design Laboratory","url":"https://health.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/NETBRECTSIN-Newsletter-Vol-6-No-2.pdf","locator":"Newsletter feature ''BIRD-Lab Takes Flight'': describes Nigerian Behavioural Insights Research and Design Laboratory and its RMNCAH+N, WASH and related focal areas.","claimRole":"contextual_use"}]}},"reviewed_by":"local_d078_item_disposition","decision_id":"D078-A34-A04-method-behavioural-insights-cycle"}'::jsonb, 'free_task_specific_learning_resource', NULL, 'English', 'Free learning resource; review the provider''s current access terms.', NULL, 'area_specific_enrichment_candidate', 'Area specific enrichment candidate', 'psychology-social-behaviour', 'optional', 'Optional intervention-design method, strongest in the documented public-health use cases; adapt and re-evidence before other sectors.'),
('subgroup', 'D078:psychology-social-behaviour', 'D078', 'competency', 'D078-A34-A04-competency-contextual-intervention-evaluation', 'Evaluate and adapt a behaviourally informed intervention in context', 'Judge whether the intended behaviour and outcome changed, whether implementation matched the design, for whom, under what context and with what uncertainty; use findings to refine or stop the intervention.', 'Prepare an evaluation note separating implementation evidence, outcome evidence, subgroup/context differences, design limitations and adapt/continue/stop reasoning. No direct curriculum transfer is asserted. D078 programme-to-domain evidence supplies route context; this area candidate is enrichment unless separately supported by programme evidence. Route note: Specialist evaluation competency for an intervention with a defined behaviour and setting.', NULL, 'build_next', 'Specialist evaluation competency for an intervention with a defined behaviour and setting.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['A34_WHO_EVALUATE_BI', 'A34_WHO_BI_STEPS', 'A34_NIGERIA_NACA_SBC', 'A34_LEARN_SURREY_BI']::text[], '[{"id":"A34_WHO_EVALUATE_BI","title":"Evaluating the impact of interventions addressing health behaviour: considerations and tools for policy-makers","url":"https://www.who.int/europe/publications/i/item/WHO-EURO-2024-10200-49972-75147","region":"WHO European Region; health","evidenceType":null},{"id":"A34_WHO_BI_STEPS","title":"Principles and steps for applying a behavioural perspective to public health","url":"https://cdn.who.int/media/docs/default-source/documents/bi-tag-technical-note1_principles-and-steps.pdf?sfvrsn=efdefb39_5","region":"international; public health","evidenceType":null},{"id":"A34_NIGERIA_NACA_SBC","title":"National HIV Self-Testing and PrEP Communication Strategy 2022","url":"https://www.naca.gov.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/National-HIVST-and-PrEP-Communication-Strategy-2022_.pdf","region":"Nigeria; HIV prevention and health communication","evide