('subgroup', 'D078:psychology-social-behaviour', 'D078', 'competency', 'D078-A04-competency-digital-data-provenance', 'Assess coverage, provenance and ethical risk in digital social data', 'The ability to explain where digital records came from, what activity they capture, who they omit, how collection can affect people and how information will be protected.', 'Document where data came from, who is missing, how platform mechanisms shape it, permissions/risks and what claims are defensible. A specialist capability for digital behavioural research; ethical reasoning also relates to the shared conditional responsibility for human/sensitive-data research, without duplicating that foundation item. Not established. Route note: A specialist safeguard for research using platform, trace or digitally mediated data.', NULL, 'build_next', 'A specialist safeguard for research using platform, trace or digitally mediated data.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['AOIR_ETHICS_GUIDELINES', 'NDPC_ACT_NIGERIA']::text[], '[{"id":"AOIR_ETHICS_GUIDELINES","title":"Internet Research: Ethical Guidelines 3.0","url":"https://aoir.org/reports/ethics3.pdf","region":"International professional research-ethics guidance","evidenceType":null},{"id":"NDPC_ACT_NIGERIA","title":"Nigeria Data Protection Act, 2023","url":"https://www.ndpc.gov.ng/ndp-act-2023/","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"AOIR_ETHICS_GUIDELINES","title":"Internet Research: Ethical Guidelines 3.0","url":"https://aoir.org/reports/ethics3.pdf","locator":"Guidelines 3.0: ethics is contextual and process-based across internet research; consider expectation of privacy, identifiability, vulnerability, platform context, data collection/reuse and researcher responsibility rather than assuming all publicly visible material is ethically free to use.","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"NDPC_ACT_NIGERIA","title":"Nigeria Data Protection Act, 2023","url":"https://www.ndpc.gov.ng/ndp-act-2023/","locator":"Official Act an