('subgroup', 'D078:psychology-social-behaviour', 'D078', 'method', 'D078-A04-method-human-in-loop-llm-qualitative-analysis', 'Human-in-the-loop LLM support for qualitative analysis', 'A workflow where a language model may assist with a narrowly stated qualitative task, while a researcher checks the source material, decides what codes mean and records corrections.', 'Test a bounded task on permitted de-identified material, compare suggestions with originals, preserve contradictions and document corrections. A specialist area application of the existing qualitative inquiry path; it is not a domain-wide tool or method requirement. No programme curriculum transfer claimed. Route note: Optional aid to organize or propose candidate codes/summaries for qualitative material; it does not perform trustworthy interpretation on its own.', NULL, 'useful_later', 'Optional aid to organize or propose candidate codes/summaries for qualitative material; it does not perform trustworthy interpretation on its own.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['AI4QUAL_TUTORIAL', 'ESSEX_GENAI_QUAL_GUIDE', 'NDPC_ACT_NIGERIA', 'AI4QUAL_PUBLIC_TUTORIAL_PAGE']::text[], '[{"id":"AI4QUAL_TUTORIAL","title":"AI4Qual: A Comprehensive Field Guide to LLM-Supported Qualitative Research","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3742414.3794947","region":"International research-methods tutorial","evidenceType":null},{"id":"ESSEX_GENAI_QUAL_GUIDE","title":"How to use Generative AI to Assist the Analysis of Qualitative Data: How-to Guide","url":"https://repository.essex.ac.uk/40034/","region":"Global methods example; institutional context is UK","evidenceType":null},{"id":"NDPC_ACT_NIGERIA","title":"Nigeria Data Protection Act, 2023","url":"https://www.ndpc.gov.ng/ndp-act-2023/","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":null},{"id":"AI4QUAL_PUBLIC_TUTORIAL_PAGE","title":"AI4Qual: A Comprehensive Field Guide to LLM-Supported Qualitative Research — public tutorial description","url":"https://iui.acm.org/2026/tutorials/","region":"Inte