('subgroup', 'D078:psychology-social-behaviour', 'D078', 'competency', 'D078-A04-competency-audit-ai-qualitative-coding', 'Audit AI suggestions against qualitative source material', 'The ability to inspect model-suggested summaries/codes alongside the original passage and decide whether the suggestion fits the research question, context and codebook.', 'Audit a sample of AI suggestions for fabricated evidence, missing counterexamples, overgeneralization and context loss; document accept/reject decisions. Specialist capability attached to the optional AI-assisted qualitative route. Not established. Route note: A required safeguard only when a learner chooses AI-assisted qualitative coding; not a general prerequisite for qualitative research.', NULL, 'build_next', 'A required safeguard only when a learner chooses AI-assisted qualitative coding; not a general prerequisite for qualitative research.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['AI4QUAL_TUTORIAL', 'ESSEX_GENAI_QUAL_GUIDE', 'AI4QUAL_PUBLIC_TUTORIAL_PAGE']::text[], '[{"id":"AI4QUAL_TUTORIAL","title":"AI4Qual: A Comprehensive Field Guide to LLM-Supported Qualitative Research","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3742414.3794947","region":"International research-methods tutorial","evidenceType":null},{"id":"ESSEX_GENAI_QUAL_GUIDE","title":"How to use Generative AI to Assist the Analysis of Qualitative Data: How-to Guide","url":"https://repository.essex.ac.uk/40034/","region":"Global methods example; institutional context is UK","evidenceType":null},{"id":"AI4QUAL_PUBLIC_TUTORIAL_PAGE","title":"AI4Qual: A Comprehensive Field Guide to LLM-Supported Qualitative Research — public tutorial description","url":"https://iui.acm.org/2026/tutorials/","region":"International research-methods instruction; conference tutorial context","evidenceType":"task_specific_learning_resource"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"AI4QUAL_TUTORIAL","title":"AI4Qual: A Comprehensive Field Guide to LLM-Supported Qualitative Research","url":"https://doi.org/10.114