('subgroup', 'D078:psychology-social-behaviour', 'D078', 'skill', 'D078-A04-skill-cognitive-pretesting-and-equivalence', 'Check how people understand a social-behaviour measure', 'The practical ability to ask a small, purposefully selected group how they interpret questions, recall information and choose answers, then identify wording or concept problems before a larger study.', 'Ask a small, suitable set of participants to explain item meaning and response choices, identify unfamiliar/sensitive terms, revise and record changes. A contextual research skill, not a clinical interview or diagnostic assessment. No programme curriculum transfer is asserted. Route note: A practical pretest skill for surveys and social-behaviour measures; not a clinical interview or diagnostic assessment.', NULL, 'build_next', 'A practical pretest skill for surveys and social-behaviour measures; not a clinical interview or diagnostic assessment.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['ITC_TEST_ADAPTATION_GUIDELINES', 'NHREC_ETHICAL_REVIEW_NIGERIA']::text[], '[{"id":"ITC_TEST_ADAPTATION_GUIDELINES","title":"ITC Guidelines for Translating and Adapting Tests, Second Edition","url":"https://www.intestcom.org/files/guideline_test_adaptation_2ed.pdf","region":"International guidance; not law or a Nigeria-specific validation study","evidenceType":null},{"id":"NHREC_ETHICAL_REVIEW_NIGERIA","title":"Ethical Review","url":"https://nhrec.gov.ng/structure/ethical-review/","region":"Nigeria","evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"ITC_TEST_ADAPTATION_GUIDELINES","title":"ITC Guidelines for Translating and Adapting Tests, Second Edition","url":"https://www.intestcom.org/files/guideline_test_adaptation_2ed.pdf","locator":"Official ITC guideline, 18 recommendations organized under preconditions, test development, confirmation, administration, scoring/interpretation and documentation; official overview at https://www.intestcom.org/page/14 explains that adaptation applies across cultural settings even with