('subgroup', 'D078:social-research-evaluation', 'D078', 'method', 'D078:social-research-evaluation:sampling-and-measurement', 'Sampling, measurement and representativeness', 'A method for deciding who or what is observed and how concepts become questions, indicators, categories or measures.', 'This is a D078 area-level addition or route-specific option, not automatically a shared domain foundation. Do not claim that the selected programme teaches this item unless programme curriculum/outcome evidence supports that exact claim; otherwise label it domain/area enrichment. Route note: Use when selecting people/cases or measuring a concept; state who or what the evidence can represent.', NULL, 'build_next', 'Use when selecting people/cases or measuring a concept; state who or what the evidence can represent.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['MAGENTA_BOOK', 'SOCIAL_SCIENCE_RESEARCH_TEXT', 'NBS_GHS_PANEL_2023_24']::text[], '[{"id":"MAGENTA_BOOK","title":"Magenta Book: Central Government guidance on evaluation","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/the-magenta-book/magenta-book-central-government-guidance-on-evaluation-html","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"SOCIAL_SCIENCE_RESEARCH_TEXT","title":"Social Science Research: Principles, Methods and Practices, revised edition","url":"https://usq.pressbooks.pub/socialscienceresearch/","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"NBS_GHS_PANEL_2023_24","title":"Nigeria General Household Survey, Panel 2023-2024, Wave 5","url":"https://microdata.nigerianstat.gov.ng/index.php/catalog/82","region":null,"evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"MAGENTA_BOOK","title":"Magenta Book: Central Government guidance on evaluation","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/the-magenta-book/magenta-book-central-government-guidance-on-evaluation-html","locator":"Sections 2.2.1-2.2.2 on understanding an intervention, theory of change and evaluation purpose/questions; survey sampling section describes probability/non-p