('subgroup', 'D078:social-research-evaluation', 'D078', 'competency', 'D078:social-research-evaluation:research-ethics-data-stewardship', 'Protect participants and handle research data responsibly', 'The ability to plan consent/permission, confidentiality, secure handling, retention, reporting and respectful engagement for the actual study.', 'This is a D078 area-level addition or route-specific option, not automatically a shared domain foundation. Do not claim that the selected programme teaches this item unless programme curriculum/outcome evidence supports that exact claim; otherwise label it domain/area enrichment. Route note: Apply safeguards when a project involves people or sensitive/identifiable data; follow Nigerian law and institutional review where applicable.', NULL, 'build_next', 'Apply safeguards when a project involves people or sensitive/identifiable data; follow Nigerian law and institutional review where applicable.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['NIGERIA_DATA_PROTECTION_ACT', 'AEA_GUIDING_PRINCIPLES', 'SOCIAL_SCIENCE_RESEARCH_TEXT']::text[], '[{"id":"NIGERIA_DATA_PROTECTION_ACT","title":"Nigeria Data Protection Act, 2023","url":"https://www.ndpc.gov.ng/ndp-act-2023/","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"AEA_GUIDING_PRINCIPLES","title":"Guiding Principles for Evaluators","url":"https://www.eval.org/About/Guiding-Principles","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"SOCIAL_SCIENCE_RESEARCH_TEXT","title":"Social Science Research: Principles, Methods and Practices, revised edition","url":"https://usq.pressbooks.pub/socialscienceresearch/","region":null,"evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"NIGERIA_DATA_PROTECTION_ACT","title":"Nigeria Data Protection Act, 2023","url":"https://www.ndpc.gov.ng/ndp-act-2023/","locator":"Official Act landing page and linked Act text; sections 24-25 address personal-data processing principles and lawful bases. For a study, check the current Act text and applicable institutional guidance rather than treating this note as legal advice.","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"AEA_GUIDING_PRINCIPLES","title":"Guiding Principles for Evaluators","url":"https://www.eval.org/About/Guiding-Principles","locator":"Guiding Principles page and Systematic Inquiry principle: data-based, thorough, methodical and contextually relevant inquiry; the five principles also include competence, integrity, respect for people, and common good/equity.","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"SOCIAL_SCIENCE_RESEARCH_TEXT","title":"Social Science Research: Principles, Methods and Practices, revised edition","url":"https://usq.pressbooks.pub/socialscienceresearch/","locator":"Table of contents: Chapter 3 The research process; 5 Research design; 6 Measurement of constructs; 7 Scale reliability and validity; 8 Sampling; 9 Survey research; 11 Case research; 12 Interpretive research; 13 Qualitative analysis; 14-15 quantitative analysis; 16 Research ethics. Online text and downloads are listed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"SOCIAL_SCIENCE_RESEARCH_TEXT","title":"Social Science Research: Principles, Methods and Practices, revised edition","url":"https://usq.pressbooks.pub/socialscienceresearch/","locator":"Table of contents: Chapter 3 The research process; 5 Research design; 6 Measurement of constructs; 7 Scale reliability and validity; 8 Sampling; 9 Survey research; 11 Case research; 12 Interpretive research; 13 Qualitative analysis; 14-15 quantitative analysis; 16 Research ethics. Online text and downloads are listed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.","claimRole":"task_specific_learning_resource"}]'::jsonb, 'nigeria_to_global', '["A privacy policy is not the same as ethics approval.","De-identification may not remove all re-identification risk; ethical duties continue during analysis/reporting.","Data-protection compliance is not equivalent to ethics approval or informed-consent adequacy; check current institutional and legal requirements for the actual study.","Apply safeguards when a project involves people or sensitive/identifiable data; follow Nigerian law and institutional review where applicable."]'::jsonb, 'source_supported_synthesis', 'medium', 'source_backed', 'linked', 'https://usq.pressbooks.pub/socialscienceresearch/', 'Social Science Research: Principles, Methods and Practices, revised edition', '{"source_id":"SOCIAL_SCIENCE_RESEARCH_TEXT","title":"Social Science Research: Principles, Methods and Practices, revised edition","publisher":"Anol Bhattacherjee / University of Southern Queensland Open Textbooks","url":"https://usq.pressbooks.pub/socialscienceresearch/","locator":"Table of contents: Chapter 3 The research process; 5 Research design; 6 Measurement of constructs; 7 Scale reliability and validity; 8 Sampling; 9 Survey research; 11 Case research; 12 Interpretive research; 13 Qualitative analysis; 14-15 quantitative analysis; 16 Research ethics. Online text and downloads are listed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.","what_it_teaches":"Nigeria''s Act supplies local personal-data obligations (sections 24-25); AEA''s principles support context-sensitive, respectful inquiry; textbook Chapter 16 is a free ethics learning section.","accessed":"2026-10-12","access_cost":"Free open textbook; CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","limits":"Compact foundational text; Chapter 16 includes Australian context and legal/institutional rules must be checked locally."}'::jsonb, '2026-10-12', 'medium', '{"url":"https://usq.pressbooks.pub/socialscienceresearch/","locator":"Table of contents: Chapter 3 The research process; 5 Research design; 6 Measurement of constructs; 7 Scale reliability and validity; 8 Sampling; 9 Survey research; 11 Case research; 12 Interpretive research; 13 Qualitative analysis; 14-15 quantitative analysis; 16 Research ethics. Online text and downloads are listed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.","supports":"Nigeria''s Act supplies local personal-data obligations (sections 24-25); AEA''s principles support context-sensitive, respectful inquiry; textbook Chapter 16 is a free ethics learn