('subgroup', 'D078:social-research-evaluation', 'D078', 'method', 'D078:social-research-evaluation:evaluation-design-and-evidence', 'Select evaluation questions, design and credible evidence', 'A method for matching evaluation purpose and intended use to process, outcome, impact, value-for-money or theory-based evidence.', 'This is a D078 area-level addition or route-specific option, not automatically a shared domain foundation. Do not claim that the selected programme teaches this item unless programme curriculum/outcome evidence supports that exact claim; otherwise label it domain/area enrichment. Route note: Use for programme, service or policy evaluation; match evaluation questions and design to available evidence and decision needs.', NULL, 'build_next', 'Use for programme, service or policy evaluation; match evaluation questions and design to available evidence and decision needs.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['CDC_EVALUATION_FRAMEWORK', 'MAGENTA_BOOK', 'AEA_COMPETENCIES', 'CDC_EVALUATION_ACTION_GUIDE']::text[], '[{"id":"CDC_EVALUATION_FRAMEWORK","title":"CDC Program Evaluation Framework","url":"https://www.cdc.gov/evaluation/php/evaluation-framework/index.html","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"MAGENTA_BOOK","title":"Magenta Book: Central Government guidance on evaluation","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/the-magenta-book/magenta-book-central-government-guidance-on-evaluation-html","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"AEA_COMPETENCIES","title":"AEA Evaluator Competencies","url":"https://www.eval.org/About/Competencies-Standards/AEA-Evaluator-Competencies","region":null,"evidenceType":null},{"id":"CDC_EVALUATION_ACTION_GUIDE","title":"CDC Program Evaluation Framework Action Guide","url":"https://www.cdc.gov/evaluation/php/evaluation-framework-action-guide/","region":null,"evidenceType":"task_specific_learning_resource"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"CDC_EVALUATION_FRAMEWORK","title":"CDC Program Evaluation Framework","url":"https:/