('subgroup', 'D078:sociology-social-anthropology', 'D078', 'tool', 'D078-SOC-KOBO-SURVEY-FIELD', 'Digital field-survey collection (KoboToolbox / KoboCollect or alternatives)', 'A configurable digital form system for collecting structured answers on web or Android devices, including offline field collection.', 'A practical collection option for community, household, and social-impact studies where digital field forms fit the sampling and connectivity plan; it is not a sociology method or survey-design substitute. Deploy an already-designed questionnaire to collect structured field responses; export a documented dataset for checking and analysis. No claim of programme teaching or provision. Route note: Show only within the selected sociology social anthropology area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: Deploy an already-designed questionnaire to collect structured field responses; export a documented dataset for checking and analysis. Guardrail: The platform cannot make a biased sample representative or a weak question valid. Offline syncing, device access, language, consent, privacy, and project account settings must be checked.', 'Deploy an already-designed questionnaire to collect structured field responses; export a documented dataset for checking and analysis.', 'useful_later', 'Show only within the selected sociology social anthropology area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: Deploy an already-designed questionnaire to collect structured field responses; export a documented dataset for checking and analysis. Guardrail: The platform cannot make a biased sample representative or a weak question valid. Offline syncing, device access, language, consent, privacy, and project account settings must be checked.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['KOBO_DATA_COLLECTION', 'KOBO_ABOUT']::text[], '[{"id":"KOBO_DATA_COLLECTION","title":"Data collection with KoboToolbox","url":"https://support.kobotoolbox.org/data-collection-tools.html","region":"Global tool documentation","evidenceType":null},{"id":"KOBO_ABOUT","title":"About KoboToolbox","url":"https://support.kobotoolbox.org/about_kobotoolbox.html","region":"Global product documentation","evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"KOBO_DATA_COLLECTION","title":"Data collection with KoboToolbox","url":"https://support.kobotoolbox.org/data-collection-tools.html","locator":"Web forms and Android KoboCollect, offline collection and selection of collection mode; updated 23 Apr 2026","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"KOBO_ABOUT","title":"About KoboToolbox","url":"https://support.kobotoolbox.org/about_kobotoolbox.html","locator":"Tool purpose in humanitarian, development, peacebuilding, human-rights, environmental and social-impact settings","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"KOBO_DATA_COLLECTION","title":"Data collection with KoboToolbox","url":"https://support.kobotoolbox.org/data-collection-tools.html","locator":"Web forms and Android KoboCollect, offline collection and selection of collection mode; updated 23 Apr 2026","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"KOBO_DATA_COLLECTION","title":"Data collection with KoboToolbox","url":"https://support.kobotoolbox.org/data-collection-tools.html","locator":"Web forms and Android KoboCollect, offline collection and selection of collection mode; updated 23 Apr 2026","claimRole":"task_specific_learning_resource"}]'::jsonb, 'global', '["The platform cannot make a biased sample representative or a weak question valid.","Offline syncing, device access, language, consent, privacy, and project account settings must be checked.","Show only within the selected sociology social anthropology area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: Deploy an already-designed questionnaire to collect structured field responses; export a documented dataset for checking and analysis. Guardrail: The platform cannot make a biased sample representative or a weak question valid. Offline syncing, device access, language, consent, privacy, and project ac