('subgroup', 'D078:sociology-social-anthropology', 'D078', 'tool', 'D078-SOC-CAQDAS-TAGUETTE-NVIVO', 'Computer-assisted qualitative analysis (Taguette / NVivo as distinct options)', 'Software that helps store, tag/code, retrieve, compare, and document qualitative materials; Taguette is an open-source option for document tagging, while NVivo is a commercial product with a broader vendor feature set.', 'Useful when volume, collaboration, or traceability makes manual filing cumbersome; not a substitute for method choice, close reading, theoretical reasoning, or ethics. Create an organized project, apply a researcher-defined code structure to material, retrieve coded passages, and export a documented analysis trail. No assumed institutional license or curriculum coverage. Route note: Show only within the selected sociology social anthropology area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: Create an organized project, apply a researcher-defined code structure to material, retrieve coded passages, and export a documented analysis trail. Guardrail: Do not imply Taguette and NVivo feature parity. Taguette is a small open-source project; check current maintenance and data hosting.', 'Create an organized project, apply a researcher-defined code structure to material, retrieve coded passages, and export a documented analysis trail.', 'useful_later', 'Show only within the selected sociology social anthropology area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: Create an organized project, apply a researcher-defined code structure to material, retrieve coded passages, and export a documented analysis trail. Guardrail: Do not imply Taguette and NVivo feature parity. Taguette is a small open-source project; check current maintenance and data hosting.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['TAGUETTE_OFFICIAL', 'NVIVO_VENDOR_OVERVIEW', 'TAGUETTE_GUIDE', 'UKDS_QUALITATIVE']::text[], '[{"id":"TAGUETTE_OFFICIAL","title":"Taguette: qualitative analysis tool","url":"https://www.taguette.org/","region":"Global software documentation","evidenceType":null},{"id":"NVIVO_VENDOR_OVERVIEW","title":"NVivo qualitative data analysis software","url":"https://lumivero.com/products/nvivo/","region":"Global vendor product; availability/licensing vary","evidenceType":null},{"id":"TAGUETTE_GUIDE","title":"User documentation and FAQ","url":"https://www.taguette.org/faq.html","region":"Global learning resource","evidenceType":null},{"id":"UKDS_QUALITATIVE","title":"Qualitative data","url":"https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/learning-hub/qualitative-data/","region":"Global learning resource; UK collection examples","evidenceType":null}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceId":"TAGUETTE_OFFICIAL","title":"Taguette: qualitative analysis tool","url":"https://www.taguette.org/","locator":"Import materials, highlight/tag, export project/codebook/quotes; local or server deployment","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"NVIVO_VENDOR_OVERVIEW","title":"NVivo qualitative data analysis software","url":"https://lumivero.com/products/nvivo/","locator":"Vendor product overview; verify current functions, editions, license and pricing before use","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"TAGUETTE_GUIDE","title":"User documentation and FAQ","url":"https://www.taguette.org/faq.html","locator":"Free/open-source, installation, getting-started guide and feature walkthrough links","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"UKDS_QUALITATIVE","title":"Qualitative data","url":"https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/learning-hub/qualitative-data/","locator":"Types of qualitative evidence, lived experience, mixed evidence, reuse and teaching resources","claimRole":null},{"sourceId":"TAGUETTE_GUIDE","title":"User documentation and FAQ","url":"https://www.taguette.org/faq.html","locator":"Free/open-source, installation, getting-started guide and feature walkthrough links","claimRole":"task_specific_learning_resource"}]'::jsonb, 'global', '["Do not imply Taguette and NVivo feature parity.","Taguette is a small open-source project; check current maintenance and data hosting.","NVivo requires checking current license/cost and data terms.","Software does not validate interpretation.","Show only within the selected sociology social anthropology area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: Create an organized project, apply a researcher-defined code structure to material, retrieve coded passages, and export a documented analysis trail. Guardrail: Do not imply Taguette and NVivo feature parity. Taguette is a small open-source project; check current maintenance and data hosting."]'::jsonb, 'source_supported_synthesis', 'medium', 'source_backed', 'linked', 'https://www.taguette.org/faq.html', 'User documentation and FAQ', '{"source_id":"TAGUETTE_GUIDE","publisher":"Taguette","title":"User documentation and FAQ","url":"https://www.taguette.org/faq.html","locator":"Free/open-source, installation, getting-started guide and feature walkthrough links","jurisdiction":"Global learning resource","evidence_use":"Free task-specific tool learning resource; not a methods credential.","accessed":"2026-10-10"}'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', 'medium', '{"url":"https://www.taguette.org/faq.html","locator":"Free/open-source, installation, getting-started guide and feature walkthrough links","supports":null,"access":null}'::jsonb, NULL, 'subgroup', '2026-10-12', 'approved', '{"claims":{"item_identity":{"source_references":[{"id":"TAGUETTE_OFFICIAL","title":"Taguette: qualitative analysis tool","url":"https://www.taguette.org/","region":"Global software documentation","evidenceType":null},{"id":"NVIVO_VENDOR_OVERVIEW","title":"NVivo qualitative data analysis software","url":"https://lumivero.com/products/nvivo/","region":"Global vendor product; availability/licensing vary","evidenceType":null}],"source_locators":[{"sourceId":"TAGUETTE_OFFICIAL","title":"Taguette: qualitative analysis tool","url":"https://www.taguette.org/","locator":"Import materials, highlight/tag, export project/codebook/quotes; local or server deployment","claimRol