ta source","claimRole":"task_specific_learning_resource"}]'::jsonb, 'global', '["Centrality is not importance in every substantive sense.","Missing ties, boundary choices, and privacy risk can distort conclusions.","A graph image is not a causal explanation.","Show only within the selected sociology social anthropology area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: Create a documented node/edge table, define what counts as a tie, calculate question-appropriate network measures, and make a readable graph with interpretation cautions. Guardrail: Centrality is not importance in every substantive sense. Missing ties, boundary choices, and privacy risk can distort conclusions."]'::jsonb, 'source_supported_synthesis', 'medium', 'source_backed', 'linked', 'https://gephi.org/quickstart/', 'Gephi Quickstart', '{"source_id":"GEPHI_QUICKSTART","publisher":"Gephi Consortium","title":"Gephi Quickstart","url":"https://gephi.org/quickstart/","locator":"Create project, import source/target edge data, explore layouts, statistics and filters; notes network construction depends on project/data source","jurisdiction":"Global software documentation","evidence_use":"Primary function and free tool learning resource; visualization choices do not establish social validity.","accessed":"2026-10-10"}'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', 'medium', '{"url":"https://gephi.org/quickstart/","locator":"Create project, import source/target edge data, explore layouts, statistics and filters; notes network construction depends on project/data source","supports":null,"access":null}'::jsonb, NULL, 'subgroup', '2026-10-12', 'approved', '{"claims":{"item_identity":{"source_references":[{"id":"UKDS_COMPUTATIONAL","title":"Computational social science","url":"https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/learning-hub/computational-social-science/","region":"Global learning resource; platform access varies","evidenceType":null},{"id":"GEPHI_QUICKSTART","title":"Gephi Quickstart","url":"https://gephi.org/quickstart/","region":"Glob