('subgroup', 'D078:sociology-social-anthropology', 'D078', 'tool', 'SOC-A2', 'Casevo LLM multi-agent social simulation', 'A research prototype built on Mesa that uses LLM-enabled agents and interaction networks to simulate social communication/decision scenarios.', 'Experimental research option for sociology/social anthropology; include only as an emerging example learners may critically inspect, not as recommended routine practice. Could be explored to test how assumptions about agents, memory and interaction affect a simulated scenario. Not a programme requirement or course claim. Route note: Show only within the selected sociology social anthropology area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: Could be explored to test how assumptions about agents, memory and interaction affect a simulated scenario. Guardrail: ArXiv preprint and prototype, demonstrated with U.S. election-debate context. Simulated responses are not real people, representative samples or reliable predictions. Bias, reproducibility, compute cost and privacy/security require review.', 'Could be explored to test how assumptions about agents, memory and interaction affect a simulated scenario.', 'useful_later', 'Show only within the selected sociology social anthropology area and relevant use case, as an optional route. Task: Could be explored to test how assumptions about agents, memory and interaction affect a simulated scenario. Guardrail: ArXiv preprint and prototype, demonstrated with U.S. election-debate context. Simulated responses are not real people, representative samples or reliable predictions. Bias, reproducibility, compute cost and privacy/security require review.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['CASEVO_PAPER', 'MESA_FRAMEWORK']::text[], '[{"id":"CASEVO_PAPER","title":"Casevo: A Cognitive Agents and Social Evolution Simulator","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.19498","region":"International research preprint","evidenceType":null},{"id":"MESA_FRAMEWORK","title":"Mesa: Agent-b